,"official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"告武威太守勿受其使","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"337b321d-fe06-4c75-90b5-90b8eea2f03d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"南單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"南单于","people_xingming":"null","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"94ea054e-db0e-11ef-b801-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"南單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"南单于","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"94ea054f-db0e-11ef-8f0f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"北匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"北匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":943,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94ea054c-db0e-11ef-aee0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武威","place_name_jianti_auto":"武威","resolved_place_entity_id":624,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94ea054d-db0e-11ef-a36d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武威","place_name_jianti_auto":"武威","resolved_place_entity_id":624,"start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"94ea0550-db0e-11ef-9a5b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"3北匈奴遣使詣武威求和親，帝召公卿廷議，不決；皇太子言曰：「南單于新附，北虜懼於見伐，故傾耳而聽，爭欲歸義耳。今未能出兵而反交通北虜，臣恐南單于將有二心，北虜降者且不復來矣。」帝然之，告武威太守勿受其使。","content_fanyi":"北匈奴单于派遣使者前往武威郡请求和亲，光武帝召集公卿在朝堂上商议，未能作出决定；皇太子进言说：“南单于刚刚归附，北匈奴害怕被我们攻伐，所以倾耳听命，争着想要归顺朝廷罢了。如今我们还没能出兵替南匈奴讨伐北匈奴，反而去与北匈奴交往，我担心南匈奴单于会怀有二心，北匈奴中投降的人也不会再来了。”光武帝认为他说得对，通知武威郡太守不要接受北匈奴使者的请求。","content_jianti_auto":"3北匈奴遣使诣武威求和亲，帝召公卿廷议，不决；皇太子言曰：「南单于新附，北虏惧于见伐，故倾耳而听，争欲归义耳。今未能出兵而反交通北虏，臣恐南单于将有二心，北虏降者且不复来矣。」帝然之，告武威太守勿受其使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3463,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"94ea0541-db0e-11ef-ba07-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"