":"陛下是对皇帝的尊称，表示至高无上的地位，在汉代用于指代皇帝。在上下文中，臧宮和馬武上书时使用此称呼，指向光武帝刘秀，作为决策者。","official_rank":"最高统治者","source_snippet":"縣在陛下","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"fac9ac5e-6031-40e9-8d5b-1924fc3287ab"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"將","official_note":"將指将领或将军，在汉代泛指军事指挥官，负责统兵作战。在上下文中，臧宮和馬武建议派遣将领到边境，以应对匈奴威胁。","official_rank":"高级将领","source_snippet":"命將臨塞","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"815ae8fc-3916-47ae-ba58-ec747ec11e6d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":58,"link_td_description":"臧宫，东汉武将。颍川郡郏人。汉光武帝功臣，云台二十八将第14位（《后汉书》列传12）。","link_td_id":"Q10006247","link_td_number_id":1236490,"people_name":"朗陵侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"朗陵侯","people_xingming":"臧宫","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94ea056b-db0e-11ef-aa76-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":58,"link_td_description":"臧宫，东汉武将。颍川郡郏人。汉光武帝功臣，云台二十八将第14位（《后汉书》列传12）。","link_td_id":"Q10006247","link_td_number_id":1236490,"people_name":"臧宮","people_name_jianti_auto":"臧宫","people_xingming":"臧宫","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94ea056c-db0e-11ef-898b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":61,"link_td_description":"马武，字子张，南阳郡湖阳（今河南唐河湖阳镇）人，东汉“云台二十八将”之一。","link_td_id":"Q10006249","link_td_number_id":942194,"people_name":"揚虛侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"扬虚侯","people_xingming":"马武","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94ea056d-db0e-11ef-b619-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":61,"link_td_description":"马武，字子张，南阳郡湖阳（今河南唐河湖阳镇）人，东汉“云台二十八将”之一。","link_td_id":"Q10006249","link_td_number_id":942194,"people_name":"馬武","people_name_jianti_auto":"马武","people_xingming":"马武","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"94ea056e-db0e-11ef-ae77-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-551,"link_death_year":-479,"link_td_description":"孔丘，春秋末期鲁国的教育家与哲学家，儒家创始人兼主要代表人物。","link_td_id":"Q10000008","link_td_number_id":484,"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","people_xingming":"孔子","start_index":290,"tongjian_id":"94eb15f1-db0e-11ef-ae5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"季孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"季孙","people_xingming":"季孙","start_index":297,"t