lace_name_jianti_auto":"北狄","resolved_place_entity_id":1051,"start_index":308,"tongjian_id":"94eb15f4-db0e-11ef-a251-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"},{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"城东南十里曰南武阳城，汉县也，属泰山郡。后汉及晋因之。刘...","context_before":"颛臾城[县西北八十里。在蒙山之阳，鲁附庸国。","source_end_index":37,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c38dd72e-885c-5f43-b3a6-cb6aa3e4cc90","source_start_index":22,"source_text":"《论语》：季氏将伐颛臾。谓此。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","内政","史论"],"content":"4朗陵侯臧宮、揚虛侯馬武上書曰：「匈奴貪利，無有禮信，窮則稽首，安則侵盜。虜今人畜疫死，旱蝗赤地，疲困乏力，不當中國一郡，萬里死命，縣在陛下；福不再來，時或易失，豈宜固守文德而墮武事乎！今命將臨塞，厚縣購賞，喻告高句驪、烏桓、鮮卑攻其左，發河西四郡、天水、隴西羌·胡擊其右，如此，北虜之滅，不過數年。臣恐陛下仁恩不忍，謀臣狐疑，令萬世刻石之功不立於聖世！」詔報曰：「黃石公記曰：『柔能制剛，弱能制強。舍近謀遠者，勞而無功；舍遠謀近者，逸而有終。故曰：務廣地者荒，務廣德者強，有其有者安，貪人有者殘。殘滅之政，雖成必敗。』今國無善政，災變不息，百姓驚惶，人不自保，而復欲遠事邊外乎！孔子曰：『吾恐季孫之憂不在顓臾。』且北狄尚強，而屯田警備，傳聞之事，恆多失實。誠能舉天下之半以滅大寇，豈非至願！苟非其時，不如息民。」自是諸將莫敢復言兵事者。","content_fanyi":"朗陵侯臧宫、扬虚侯马武上书说：“匈奴贪图财利，不守礼义信用，穷困时就叩头称臣，安定下来就侵扰劫掠。北匈奴如今人畜染疫而死，旱灾蝗灾使大地光赤，疲惫困乏、力量不足，还抵不上中原一个郡；他们虽在万里之外，死生之命却悬在陛下手中。福运不会再来，时机容易失去，怎么可以固守文治德行而毁弃武备之事呢！如今应当命令将领前往边塞，以重金悬赏，传告高句丽、乌桓、鲜卑进攻它的东部，征调河西四郡、天水、陇西的羌人和胡人攻击它的西部，这样，北匈奴的灭亡，不过几年。臣等担心陛下仁爱恩厚，不忍心这样做，谋臣犹豫不决，使刻石流传万代的功业不能在圣明之世建立！”诏书答复说：“《黄石公记》说：‘柔能克刚，弱能胜强。舍弃近处而图谋远方，劳而无功；舍弃远方而图谋近处，安逸而有成。所以说：一心开拓土地的会使自身疲惫，一心推广德行的会日益强盛，保有自己所有的会得到安定，贪图别人所有的会变得残暴。残暴的政令，即使一时成功也必定失败。’如今国家没有善政，灾变不断，百姓惊惶，人人不能自保，怎么还想要远赴边塞之外去兴兵动武呢！孔子说：‘我担心季孙氏的忧患不在颛臾，而在萧墙之内。’况且北狄还很强大，而屯田警备之事，传闻常常多与事实不符。果真能拿出半个天下来消灭大敌，难道不是朕最大的愿望吗！如果时机未到，不如让百姓休养生息。”从此以后，众将领没有人敢再谈论用兵之事。","content_jianti_auto":"4朗陵侯臧宫、扬虚侯马武上书曰：「匈奴贪利，无有礼信，穷则稽首，安则侵盗。虏今人畜疫死，旱蝗赤地，疲困乏力，不当中国一郡，万里死命，县在陛下；福不再来，时或易失，岂宜固守文德而堕武事乎！今命将临塞，厚县购赏，喻告高句骊、乌桓、鲜卑攻其左，发河西四郡、天水、陇西羌·胡击其右，如此，北虏之灭，不过数年。臣恐陛下仁恩不忍，谋臣狐疑，令万世刻石之功不立于圣世！」诏报曰：「黄石公记曰：『柔能制刚，弱能制强。舍近谋远者，劳而无功；舍远谋近者，逸而有终。故曰：务广地者荒，务广德者强，有其有者安，贪人有者残。残灭之政，虽成必败。』今国无善政，灾变不息，百姓惊惶，人不自保，而复欲远事边外乎！孔子曰：『吾恐季孙之忧不在颛臾。』且北狄尚强，而屯田警备，传闻之事，恒多失实。诚能举天下之半以灭大寇，岂非至愿！苟非其时，不如息民。」自是诸将莫敢复言兵事者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"奈之何延之于萧墙之内也！","context_before":"...贤豪，委顺而趋新焉。迤及于千岁以后，而忘其为谁氏之族矣。","source_end_index":204,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2f5e6a93-43d2-4807-bb25-d0485548e572","source_start_index":178,"source_text":"臧宫、马武请北伐，光武曰：“吾恐季孙之忧不在颛臾。”"}],"title":"三六 内迁南单于非计"}],"id":3464,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"94ea0551-db0e-11ef-8d27-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000680"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"興","people_name_jianti_auto":"兴","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94eb15f7-db0e-11ef-b35c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"縯","people_name_jianti_auto":"𬙂","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"94eb15f8-db0e-11ef-a7db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"石","people_name_jianti_auto":"石","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"94eb15f9-db0e-11ef-92be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94eb15fa-db0e-11ef-95db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"縯","people_name_jianti_auto":"𬙂","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"94eb15fb-db0e-11ef-a034-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"興，縯之次子。石，章之子，縯之嫡孫也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"兴，𬙂之次子。石，章之子，𬙂之嫡孙也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"94eb15f6-db0e-11ef-8377-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"魯王","official_note":"魯王是漢代分封的諸侯王，負責管理魯國地區，此處指劉興被遣就國，體現皇帝對諸王就國政策的實施。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"魯王興","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"17258098-f719-466e-a28f-30096c42ebe8"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"齊王","official_note":"齊王是漢代分封的諸侯王，負責管理齊國地區，此處指劉石被遣就國，與魯王一同反映皇帝推行諸王就國以加強中央集權。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"齊王石","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8d1f8fba-dd4a-4363-8761-983571838bc8"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-4,"link_death_year":80,"link_td_description":"赵憙，字伯阳，南阳郡宛县（今河南南阳）人，东汉初期大臣。","link_td_id":"Q10002792","link_td_number_id":1556313,"people_name":"趙熹","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵熹","people_xingming":"赵熹","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"94eb15fc-db0e-11ef-9b09-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-4,"link_death_year":80,"link_td_description":"赵憙，字伯阳，南阳郡宛县（今河南南阳）人，东汉初期大臣。","link_td_id":"Q10002792","link_td_number_id":1556313,"people_name":"熹","people_name_jianti_auto":"熹","people_xingming":"赵熹","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"94eb15fd-db0e-11ef-b75f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":64,"link_td_description":"刘兴，汉景帝后裔，远祖长沙王刘发，父齐武王刘縯。","link_td_id":"Q10016919","link_td_number_id":4383460,"people_name":"魯王","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲁王","people_xingming":"刘兴","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"94eb15fe-db0e-11ef-bb40-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":64,"link_td_description":"刘兴，汉景帝后裔，远祖长沙王刘发，父齐武王刘縯。","link_td_id":"Q10016919","link_td_number_id":4383460,"people_name":"興","people_name_jianti_auto":"兴","people_xingming":"刘兴","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"94eb15ff-db0e-11ef-9036-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"刘硕，又作刘顾、刘石，汉桓帝的弟弟，蠡吾侯刘翼的儿子，汉章帝的曾孙，河间孝王刘开的孙子。","link_td_id":"Q10004278","link_td_number_id":5965984,"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","people_xingming":"刘石","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"94eb1600-db0e-11ef-868e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"刘硕，又作刘顾、刘石，汉桓帝的弟弟，蠡吾侯刘翼的儿子，汉章帝的曾孙，河间孝王刘开的孙子。","link_td_id":"Q10004278","link_td_number_id":5965984,"people_name":"石","people_name_jianti_auto":"石","people_xingming":"刘石","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"94eb1601-db0e-11ef-ad1e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"5上問趙熹以久長之計，熹請遣諸王就國。冬，上始遣魯王興、齊王石就國。","content_fanyi":"光武帝向赵熹询问国家长治久安的计策，赵熹建议下令让各诸侯王返回封国。冬季，光武帝开始派遣鲁王刘兴、齐王刘石返回封国。","content_jianti_auto":"5上问赵熹以久长之计，熹请遣诸王就国。冬，上始遣鲁王兴、齐王石就国。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3465,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94eb15f5-db0e-11ef-9215-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":5,"chapter_name":"避讳篇第五","chenzhu_chapter":"避讳为民国以前吾国特有之体制，故史书上之记载，有待于以避讳解释者甚众，不讲避讳学，不足以读中国之史也，吾昔撰《史讳举例》问世，职为是焉。胡身之生避讳最盛之朝，熟谙避讳掌故。其撰《通鉴释文辨误後序》，谓：“海陵所刊公休《释文》，以乌桓为乌元。宋朝钦宗讳桓，靖康之初，公休没久矣，安得预为钦宗讳！”即利用避讳以证史书伪讬之一法。其注《通鉴》，以避讳为训释者尤多。兹所采不过数十条，而避讳常识已略具于是矣。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":6,"chenzhu_text":"此条前半避讳改地名，後半避讳改前人谥。宋太祖祖名敬。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":19,"tongjian_id":"CH05-CZ006"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵王","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"94eb1604-db0e-11ef-85c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"良","people_name_jianti_auto":"良","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"94eb1605-db0e-11ef-885a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宏","people_name_jianti_auto":"宏","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"94eb1606-db0e-11ef-8c2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"敬侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"敬侯","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"94eb1607-db0e-11ef-a0f6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"恭侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"恭侯","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"94eb1608-db0e-11ef-a3ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"溫公","people_name_jianti_auto":"温公","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"94eb1609-db0e-11ef-8fa8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"袁","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"94eb160a-db0e-11ef-bd41-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"范","people_name_jianti_auto":"范","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"94eb160b-db0e-11ef-94cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"壽張縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"寿张县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94eb160c-db0e-11ef-a45e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東平國","place_name_jianti_auto":"东平国","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94eb160d-db0e-11ef-aa1d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94eb160e-db0e-11ef-b74d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"良","place_name_jianti_auto":"良","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"94eb160f-db0e-11ef-90c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94eb1610-db0e-11ef-9d91-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"壽良","place_name_jianti_auto":"寿良","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"94eb1611-db0e-11ef-bc7e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"壽張","place_name_jianti_auto":"寿张","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"94eb1612-db0e-11ef-a87f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"壽張縣，屬東平國，春秋曰良，漢曰壽良，帝避叔父趙王良諱，改曰壽張。宏，帝舅也，諡敬侯；曰恭侯，溫公避國諱也。考異曰：袁紀「宏」皆作「密」，今從范書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"寿张县，属东平国，春秋曰良，汉曰寿良，帝避叔父赵王良讳，改曰寿张。宏，帝舅也，谥敬侯；曰恭侯，温公避国讳也。考异曰：袁纪「宏」皆作「密」，今从范书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94eb1603-db0e-11ef-ae79-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朝，直遙翻；下同。上，時掌翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朝，直遥翻；下同。上，时掌翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"94eb1616-db0e-11ef-9fda-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"逮，及也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"逮，及也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"94eb1617-db0e-11ef-9fac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宏","people_name_jianti_auto":"宏","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"94eb161a-db0e-11ef-bcf3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"古夫婦合葬，詩曰：穀則異室，死則同穴是也。同墳異藏自宏始。","note_content_jianti_auto":"古夫妇合葬，诗曰：谷则异室，死则同穴是也。同坟异藏自宏始。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"94eb1619-db0e-11ef-b605-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":51,"link_td_description":"樊宏，字靡卿，南阳郡湖阳县人，汉光武帝的舅父，为人谨慎，性情温厚。王莽末年，与族人共同筑营自守，拱卫乡里。东汉立国后，拜特进、光禄大夫，建武十五年封寿张侯，建武二十七年病重去世，谥号“恭”。","link_td_id":"Q10014104","link_td_number_id":1755339,"people_name":"壽張恭侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿张恭侯","people_xingming":"樊宏","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94eb161c-db0e-11ef-b8dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":51,"link_td_description":"樊宏，字靡卿，南阳郡湖阳县人，汉光武帝的舅父，为人谨慎，性情温厚。王莽末年，与族人共同筑营自守，拱卫乡里。东汉立国后，拜特进、光禄大夫，建武十五年封寿张侯，建武二十七年病重去世，谥号“恭”。","link_td_id":"Q10014104","link_td_number_id":1755339,"people_name":"樊宏","people_name_jianti_auto":"樊宏","people_xingming":"樊宏","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"94eb161d-db0e-11ef-a36d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":51,"link_td_description":"樊宏，字靡卿，南阳郡湖阳县人，汉光武帝的舅父，为人谨慎，性情温厚。王莽末年，与族人共同筑营自守，拱卫乡里。东汉立国后，拜特进、光禄大夫，建武十五年封寿张侯，建武二十七年病重去世，谥号“恭”。","link_td_id":"Q10014104","link_td_number_id":1755339,"people_name":"宏","people_name_jianti_auto":"宏","people_xingming":"樊宏","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94eb161e-db0e-11ef-be34-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":51,"link_td_description":"樊宏，字靡卿，南阳郡湖阳县人，汉光武帝的舅父，为人谨慎，性情温厚。王莽末年，与族人共同筑营自守，拱卫乡里。东汉立国后，拜特进、光禄大夫，建武十五年封寿张侯，建武二十七年病重去世，谥号“恭”。","link_td_id":"Q10014104","link_td_number_id":1755339,"people_name":"壽張侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿张侯","people_xingming":"樊宏","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"94eb161f-db0e-11ef-b768-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"94eb1602-db0e-11ef-9144-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"jiù","source_anchor_text":"用以為棺柩一藏不宜","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":97,"text":"柩","tongjian_id":"2e4e0b78-8ee2-5ec0-b1ef-86f09c09f8db"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"6是歲，帝舅壽張恭侯樊宏薨。宏爲人，謙柔畏愼，每當朝會，輒迎期先到，俯伏待事；所上便宜，手自書寫，毀削草本；公朝訪逮，不敢衆對。宗族染其化，未嘗犯法。帝甚重之。及病困，遺令薄葬，一無所用，以爲棺柩一藏，不宜復見，如有腐敗，傷孝子之心，使與夫人同墳異藏。帝善其令，以書示百官，因曰：「今不順壽張侯意，無以彰其德；且吾萬歲之後，欲以爲式。」","content_fanyi":"这一年，光武帝的舅舅寿张恭侯樊宏去世。樊宏为人谦和柔顺、敬畏谨慎，每到朝会时，总是先期赶到，俯身伏地等候差遣；他上奏的应兴应革条陈，都亲手书写，随后销毁草稿；在公开朝会上被皇上询问政事时，从不敢当众对答。宗族中人受他感化，不曾有人犯法。光武帝十分敬重他。等到他病重时，留下遗命薄葬，一概不用任何随葬品，认为棺柩一经埋藏，就不应再被打开看见，如果尸体腐败，会伤害孝子之心，因此让自己与夫人同坟而不同穴安葬。光武帝赞赏他的遗令，把遗书展示给百官看，并说：“如今不顺从寿张侯的心意，就无法彰显他的美德；况且我去世之后，想以此作为法式。”","content_jianti_auto":"6是岁，帝舅寿张恭侯樊宏薨。宏为人，谦柔畏愼，每当朝会，辄迎期先到，俯伏待事；所上便宜，手自书写，毁削草本；公朝访逮，不敢众对。宗族染其化，未尝犯法。帝甚重之。及病困，遗令薄葬，一无所用，以为棺柩一藏，不宜复见，如有腐败，伤孝子之心，使与夫人同坟异藏。帝善其令，以书示百官，因曰：「今不顺寿张侯意，无以彰其德；且吾万岁之后，欲以为式。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3466,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94eb1602-db0e-11ef-9144-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二十七年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二十七年","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94ea0538-db0e-11ef-9aac-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（辛亥、五一）","year_int":51},"message":"success","success":true}